    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d109-a1">

                <pb facs="0110" n="788" sameAs="frus:frus1863p2/pg788"/>

                <head>[Enclosure.]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Confederate States Steamer
                                Florida</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic">Brest</hi>,</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1863-09-03"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >September</hi> 3, 1863.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> Herewith I send you a list of men
                    discharged from the Florida, with their accounts and discharges. Many of them
                    have asked for transfers, and others for reference to you, or to a confederate
                    agent. I would request you to provide them situations in the service.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, sir, very respectfully, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>J. N. MAFFITT, <hi rendition="#italic">Commander, Confederate States
                            Navy.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
